@startuml
title Component Diagram - Subsystem, Provided Interface va Required Interface

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 80
left to right direction

package "Frontend" <<subsystem>> {
  component "Dashboard UI" as DashboardUI <<component>>
  component "Auth Provider" as AuthProvider <<component>>
  component "API Client" as ApiClient <<component>>
}

package "Backend" <<subsystem>> {
  component "AuthController" as AuthController <<component>>
  component "DashboardController" as DashboardController <<component>>
  component "TelemetryController" as TelemetryController <<component>>
  component "ControlController" as ControlController <<component>>
  component "CommandController" as CommandController <<component>>
  component "Business Services" as Services <<component>>
  component "Repositories" as Repositories <<component>>
}

database "PostgreSQL" as PostgreSQL <<datastore>>

package "Device Integration" <<subsystem>> {
  component "gateway.py" as Gateway <<component>>
  component "virtual_device_simulator.py" as Simulator <<component>>
}

component "Camera Service\ncamera_interface.py" as CameraService <<component>>

interface "IAuthAPI" as IAuth
interface "IDashboardAPI" as IDashboard
interface "ITelemetryAPI" as ITelemetry
interface "IControlAPI" as IControl
interface "ICommandPollingAPI" as ICommand
interface "ICameraAPI" as ICamera
interface "JDBC" as JDBC

DashboardUI --> ApiClient : uses
AuthProvider --> ApiClient : uses

ApiClient ..> IAuth : requires socket
ApiClient ..> IDashboard : requires socket
ApiClient ..> IControl : requires socket

IAuth - AuthController : provides lollipop
IDashboard - DashboardController : provides lollipop
ITelemetry - TelemetryController : provides lollipop
IControl - ControlController : provides lollipop
ICommand - CommandController : provides lollipop

AuthController --> Services
DashboardController --> Services
TelemetryController --> Services
ControlController --> Services
CommandController --> Services
Services --> Repositories

Repositories ..> JDBC : requires socket
JDBC - PostgreSQL : provides lollipop

Simulator --> Gateway : sends telemetry / polls command
Gateway ..> ITelemetry : requires socket
Gateway ..> ICommand : requires socket
Gateway ..> ICamera : requires socket
ICamera - CameraService : provides lollipop

note right of ApiClient
Port: HTTP API client
Required sockets:
IAuthAPI, IDashboardAPI, IControlAPI
end note

note right of Gateway
Port: Device integration client
Required sockets:
ITelemetryAPI, ICommandPollingAPI, ICameraAPI
end note

note bottom of Repositories
Port: JDBC data access
Required socket: JDBC
end note

@enduml
